by object condition: nine;
by predominance condition: nine;
by proximity condition: nine;
by contiguity condition: nine;
by conascence condition: nine;
by mutuality condition: nine;
by support condition: nine;
by decisive-support condition: nine;
by prenascence condition: three;
by postnascence condition: three;
by repetition condition: nine;
by kamma condition: three;
